===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|*}}

# {{lb|en|physics}} The [[study]] and use of [[electrical]] [[device]]s that operate by controlling the flow of [[electron]]s or other [[electric charge|electrically charged]] [[particle]]s or by converting the flow of [[charged]] particles to or from other forms of [[energy]].
#: {{ux|en|'''Electronics''' is a popular subject.}}
# {{lb|en|in the plural}} Devices which require the [[flow]] of [[electrons]] through [[conductor]]s and [[semiconductor]]s in order to perform their [[function]]; devices that operate on electrical [[power]] ([[battery]] or [[outlet]])
#: {{ux|en|Look at all the '''electronics''' in this room!}} {{rfex|en}}
# [[electronic|Electronic]] [[circuitry]].
#: {{ux|en|The '''electronics''' is the difference between a modern and an old-fashioned thermostat.}}
#: {{ux|en|The '''electronics''' are completely updated.}}

